  keywords                = {Adaptive control systems; Backstepping; Chaos control; Circuit simulation; Lyapunov methods; Synchronization; Time domain analysis; Transient analysis, Adaptive backstepping; Adaptive backstepping synchronization; Co-existing attractors; Equilibrium point; Extreme multistability; Jerk chaotic system; Lyapunov exponent; Multistability; Synchronous control; Transient chaos, Chaotic systems},
