  keywords                = {Brain; Decision trees; Electroencephalography; Electrophysiology; Feature extraction; Functional electric stimulation, Conditional mutual information; Data length; Disorder of consciousness; Features selection; Functional connectivity; Machine-learning; Minimally conscious state; Permutation conditional mutual information; Time-delays; Transcranial magnetic stimulation, Time delay, adult; aged; Article; consciousness; consciousness disorder; controlled study; decision tree; diagnostic accuracy; electroencephalography; evoked cortical response; feature selection; female; functional connectivity; human; learning algorithm; major clinical study; male; minimally conscious state; permutation conditional mutual information; persistent vegetative state; quantitative analysis; retrospective study; transcranial magnetic stimulation; adolescent; algorithm; brain cortex; consciousness disorder; diagnosis; diagnostic imaging; evoked response; middle aged; nerve cell network; pathophysiology; physiology; procedures; reproducibility; young adult, Adolescent; Adult; Aged; Algorithms; Cerebral Cortex; Consciousness Disorders; Electroencephalography; Evoked Potentials; Female; Humans; Male; Middle Aged; Nerve Net; Reproducibility of Results; Transcranial Magnetic Stimulation; Young Adult},
