  keywords                = {Anthropogenic; Climate change; Evapotranspiration; Rivers; SWAT, Ahar chay watershed; Budyko's models; Change-points; Evapotranspiration models; Human activities; Penman Monteith; Penman-monteith-leuning evapotranspiration model; Soil and water assessment tool model; Soil and Water assessment tools; Tool models, Watersheds, climate change; climate effect; evapotranspiration; human activity; NDVI; runoff; soil and water assessment tool; streamflow; vegetation cover, Aharchay Basin; East Azerbaijan; Iran},
