  keywords                = {Condition monitoring; Cutting tools; Milling (machining); Wear of materials, Health indicators; Machining parts; Milling tools; Multi-sensor fusion; New approaches; Part quality; Tool condition monitoring; Tool wear; Tool wear monitoring; Wear process, Principal component analysis},
