  keywords                = {Biomedical signal processing; Classification (of information); Convolution; Convolutional neural networks; Gesture recognition; Network architecture; Palmprint recognition, Analysis techniques; Convolutional neural network; Hand-gesture recognition; Human Machine Interface; Human movements; Mode decomposition; Movement intentions; Novel methods; Surface electromyography; Surface electromyography signals, Mode decomposition},
