  keywords                = {Change detection; Directed graphs; Entropy; Phase space methods, Acyclic graphs; Behavioral change detection; Behavioral changes; Change detection; Directed acyclic graph; Industrial maintenance; Permutation entropy; Phase spaces; Proximity networks; Subgraphs, Complex networks},
