  keywords                = {Distributed power generation; Eigenvalues and eigenfunctions; Entropy; Power quality; Solar energy; Wind power, Active distribution network; Active distributions; Disturbance signals; Features extraction; High permeability; Multi-scales; Network-based; Power quality disturbances; Wavelets transform; Wind power generation, Wavelet transforms},
