  abstract                = {The relevant properties of chaotic systems are closely related to the basic principles of confusion and diffusion in cryptography, which make chaotic systems widely used in chaotic secure communications. However, when the chaotic system is imple-mented on hardware devices with limited computational precision, the dynamics of chaos will be degraded to varying degrees. In order to resist the dynamic degradation of digital chaos, we proposed a new anti-degeneration method to improve the complexity, random-ness, and ergodicity of discrete chaotic sequences. Numerical simulations were performed to evaluate the effectiveness of the proposed method. Moreover, a PRNG is designed with good performance. © 2022; Taiwan Ubiquitous Information CO LTD. All rights reserved.},
