  keywords                = {Bridge piers; Hydraulics; Kinetics; Piers; Sand; Vortex flow; Water quality, Complex nature; Down-stream; Flow hydrodynamics; Fluvial hydraulics; Horseshoe vortices; Sand mining; Sediment mining; Streambeds; Turbulent horseshoe vortex; Turbulent kinetic energy, Kinetic energy},
