  keywords                = {Entropy; Fiber optics; Gyroscopes; Inertial navigation systems, De-Noise; Denoising methods; Fibre optics gyroscopes; Inertial measurements; Intrinsic Mode functions; Means square errors; Mode decomposition; Permutation entropy; Variational mode decomposition; Wavelet, Mean square error},
