  keywords                = {Data acquisition; Data mining; Feature extraction; Matrix algebra; Signal processing; Wind power; Wind turbines, Kernel principal component analyses (KPCA); Operating condition; Permutation entropy; Principal Components; Residual subspaces; Subspace reconstruction; Supervisory control and dataacquisition systems (SCADA); Wind turbine faults, Fault detection},
