  keywords                = {Fiber Bragg gratings; Railroad tunnels; Railroads; Signal processing; Spectral density, Application requirements; Event recognition; Experimental demonstrations; Local characteristics; Multi scale analysis; Permutation entropy; Root Mean Square; Spectral subtractions, Signaling},
