  keywords                = {Calculations; Dynamical systems; Electrocardiography; Entropy; Fourier series; Iterative methods; Time delay, Distribution entropies; ECG signals; Fractional calculus; Fractional distribution; Nonlinearity analysis; Ordinal pattern; Scale theory; Surrogate data analysis, Time series analysis},
