  keywords            = {Entropy; Noise pollution; Power quality; Spurious signal noise; Transients; Wavelet decomposition, Adaptive noise; Ensemble empirical mode decomposition; Intrinsic Mode functions; LabViEW; Permutation entropy; Quality detection system; Undecimated wavelet transform; Wavelet threshold de-noising, Signal denoising},
  language            = {English},
